+Existing boundaries absorb this correction. Shared `LiveAgentInputSnapshot`/`agentInputStateSchema` and the input handler already own the common shape/meaning; do not create an Agent-root queue type. The root package specializes that existing child snapshot without importing Org run lifecycle. Root event publisher supplies its existing barrier. Frontend activity policy remains below the activity-store API; transient stop/read identity stays at collaboration-store owner. Existing folder placement is sufficient; no new subsystem hierarchy or generic base class.
